the measured upgrade probability and its tail, or the fallback
itself can miss the deadline. Warm starts may reduce iterations,
but the initial vector, residual, precision, and stopping rule must
be versioned with the solver configuration. The implementation
log therefore records solver ID, actual iteration count, residual
