APPENDIX D
COMPLETE LEVEL-3 WAVEFORM EVIDENCE
Table XI evaluates every executable waveform tool in every
formal scene. A row marked infeasible violates at least one
reliability, ACLR, latency, power, or complexity gate. Large
energy and latency values in failed high-mobility or overloaded
orthogonal links are consequences of the current retransmission
abstraction and should be read as failure indicators, not as
hardware predictions.
